anels with MPPT controller. Good starting point for a small workshop. Battery and inverter sold separately.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at Home Depot\ue202https://www.homedepot.com/p/Renogy-400-Watt-12V-Off-Grid-Solar-Starter-Kit-w-4-Piece-100W-Monocrystalline-Panel-and-40A-MPPT-Rover-Charge-Controller-STARTER400DR40/302779450?fp=oai&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn855786product2\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn855786product2\",\"400W 12V Complete Solar Panel Kit with 2.4kWh Batteries\"]\ue201**\n\n\\$2,599.99\n\n400W complete solar system with battery storage, suitable for more substantial shed electricity needs.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at Renogy\ue202https://www.renogy.com/products/400w-12-volt-complete-solar-kit-with-two-100ah-deep-cycle-agm-lifepo4-batteries?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=43178701095027&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## How much solar power does your shed need?\n\n| Intended use | Suggested solar capacity |\n|--------|--------|\n| LED lights only | 10\u201350W |\n| Lights, phone charging, security camera | 100W |\n| Lights, fan, laptop, tool charging | 200\u2013400W |\n| Workshop with power tools | 400\u2013800W or more |\n\nThese are approximate starting points. Actual requirements depend on daily energy"}]} 

